<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 123 0 R
/E (AIagents increasingly read documents, browse webpages, and call tools \(files, email, search, databases\) to complete tasks on a user's behalf. Retrieved content is fed into the model's context alongside the user's request, and the model cannot reliably tell a genuine user instruction from data it has retrieved. )
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
