<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 127 0 R
/E (Database administrators struggle to maintain optimal performance in massive relational databases as application query patterns evolve over time. Identifying missing composite indexes, implementing sharding, or manually rewriting complex joins is a heavy operational burden that risks disrupting live production environments. Furthermore, leveraging AI to solve this introduces severe security risks, as exposing raw, sensitive company data to AI tuning models violates privacy and compliance standards. )
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [5]
>>
